## 📝 Headings

Create a hierarchy in your notes using `#` symbols:

```markdown
# Chapter Title (H1)
## Section (H2)
### Subsection (H3)
#### Topic (H4)
##### Subtopic (H5)
###### Detail (H6)
```

**Tip:** Use headings to organize lecture notes, study guides, or project outlines!

---

## ✨ Text Emphasis

Make your text stand out:

| Style | Syntax | Result |
|-------|--------|--------|
| Bold | `**bold**` or `__bold__` | **bold** |
| Italic | `*italic*` or `_italic_` | *italic* |
| Bold + Italic | `***both***` | ***both*** |
| Strikethrough | `~~crossed out~~` | ~~crossed out~~ |

**Example:**
```markdown
This is **important** and this is *emphasized*.
You can also use ***both together*** for maximum impact!
```

