## 📋 Lists

### Unordered Lists (Bullet Points)
```markdown
- First item
- Second item
  - Nested item
  - Another nested item
- Third item
```

### Ordered Lists (Numbered)
```markdown
1. First step
2. Second step
   1. Sub-step A
   2. Sub-step B
3. Third step
```

### Task Lists (Checklists)
Perfect for tracking study tasks!
```markdown
- [x] Complete Chapter 1 reading
- [x] Review lecture notes
- [ ] Practice problems 1-10
- [ ] Prepare for quiz
```

