## 🎓 Study Note Templates

### Lecture Notes Template
```markdown
# [Course Name] - Lecture [#]
**Date:** [Date]
**Topic:** [Topic]

## Key Concepts
- Concept 1
- Concept 2

## Notes
[Your notes here]

## Questions to Review
- [ ] Question 1
- [ ] Question 2

## Summary
> [Brief summary of lecture]
```

### Flashcard Style
```markdown
## Term: [Word/Concept]
**Definition:** [Explanation]

**Example:** [Usage example]

**Related:** [Connected concepts]
```

### Cornell Notes Style
```markdown
# Topic: [Subject]

| Cues/Questions | Notes |
|----------------|-------|
| What is X? | X is defined as... |
| Why is Y important? | Y matters because... |

## Summary
[2-3 sentence summary]
```

